    rectangle "**Trainer.train() 主循环**\n//trainer.py:5384//\n\nfor step in range(total_steps):\n  raw_batch = iterator_fn()\n  prepared_batch = self.prepare_batch(raw_batch)\n  model_pred = self.model_predict(prepared_batch)\n  loss = self.model.loss(prepared_batch, model_pred)\n  loss.backward()\n  optimizer.step()" as TRAIN_LOOP #BBDEFB

    rectangle "**数据取出链 (每step)**\n\n**Sampler** //sampler.py:895//\n  选bucket → 随机抽batch_size张路径\n  yield tuple({path,caption,metadata} × N)\n  **只有路径和文本, 没有tensor!**\n         ↓\n**Dataset** //dataset.py:47//\n  分拣: training_samples vs conditioning\n  校验: 同batch宽高比一致\n  **还是没有tensor!**\n         ↓\n**DataLoader** (batch_size=1, 透传)\n         ↓\n**collate_fn** //collate.py:554//\n  **重活在这里:**\n  1. caption dropout (CFG训练端)\n  2. 读 .pt 缓存 → latent tensor\n  3. 读 text embedding 缓存\n  4. 计算 SDXL time_ids\n  5. torch.stack() 堆叠\n         ↓\n  输出: {latent_batch, prompt_embeds,\n         add_time_ids, ...} 全是tensor" as DATA_CHAIN #90CAF9
}

note right of DATA_CHAIN
  **为什么读缓存放在collate_fn?**

  SimpleTuner支持多存储后端:
  本地 / S3 / HuggingFace Hub
  collate_fn 通过 backend_id 路由
  到对应的缓存系统

  **Kohya不需要这样:**
  只有一个本地文件夹
  Dataset直接返回tensor
  collate只做stack
end note

